        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">IoT telemetry, predictive maintenance, supply chain analytics, and quality control require scalable platforms for high-velocity sensor data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Logistics</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Real-time tracking, route optimization, fleet management, and global supply chain visibility require event-driven platforms with stream processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Telecom</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Network analytics, customer churn prediction, billing data processing, and 5G service assurance demand high-throughput data platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Education</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Learning analytics, student performance tracking, and institutional reporting require platforms integrating LMS, SIS, and assessment data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Government</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Citizen services analytics, policy impact assessment, and open data initiatives require secure, compliant platforms with strong audit trails.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Media &amp; Entertainment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Content recommendation, audience analytics, ad targeting, and streaming quality monitoring require platforms processing petabytes of behavioral data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">SaaS</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Product analytics, customer health scoring, usage-based billing, and feature adoption require multi-tenant platforms with self-service analytics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Energy &amp; Utilities</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Smart meter data, grid analytics, predictive maintenance, and sustainability reporting require scalable platforms for massive time-series data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Life Sciences</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Clinical trial data, genomic processing, drug discovery analytics, and regulatory submissions require secure, compliant, and scalable data platforms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

